    <string name="edit_collection_crop_info_title">Crop rule</string>
    <string name="edit_collection_crop_info_body">
        Sets how this collection\'s images are placed by default when their shape doesn\'t match the screen.
        \n\n• Center keeps the middle of the image and crops both edges.
        \n• Left keeps the left edge.
        \n• Right keeps the right edge.
        \n• Fit shows the whole image without cropping, adding black bars if needed.
        \n\nEach wallpaper can be adjusted individually in its editor ignoring the general crop rule.
    </string>
