    <string name="settings_wallpaper_mode_subtitle">Recreation of the Nothing OS Atmosphere effect</string>
    <string name="settings_wallpaper_mode_dialog_title">Atmosphere effect</string>
    <string name="settings_wallpaper_mode_dialog_body">
        Atmosphere is a live wallpaper that replicates Nothing OS\'s unlock effect of the same name: your sharp photo shows on the
        lock screen and morphs into an abstract color atmosphere when you unlock.
        \n\nIt requires confirming on a system screen. May use slightly more battery than a static wallpaper.
        \n\nRequires both screens, so turning it on removes any separate lock screen wallpaper you have set.
